sequenceDiagram
    actor V as Visitor
    participant W as Widget (embedded JS)
    participant API as POST /api/widget/chat
    participant Visitor_Svc as VisitorProfile Service
    participant RAG as RAG (hybrid_search)
    participant LLM as AI Provider (OpenRouter)
    participant DB as Postgres

    V->>W: Types a question
    W->>API: chat(public_key, visitor_id, message)
    API->>API: check widget live, domain allow-list, rate limit
    API->>Visitor_Svc: upsert visitor profile + load memory digest
    API->>DB: get/create Conversation + persist user Message
    API->>RAG: hybrid_search(query, knowledge_base_id)
    RAG-->>API: top chunks + citations (confidence high)
    API->>LLM: generate grounded answer (context + question)
    LLM-->>API: answer text
    API->>DB: persist AI Message (grounded=true, sources, confidence)
    API->>Visitor_Svc: append memory digest
    API-->>W: answer + sources + related questions
    W-->>V: renders answer with citations
